---
import { Compass, Layers, Scale } from '@lucide/astro'
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro'
---
<section class="section focus-section" id="focus" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-topline"><SectionHeading label="AREAS OF FOCUS" title="Connecting strategy, technology and transformation." id="focus-title" /><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span></div>
    <div class="focus-grid">
      <article class="focus-card">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box"><Compass size={23} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true" /></span><span>01</span></div>
        <h3>Business Transformation</h3>
        <p>Technology should change how a business operates, not simply automate the way it works today.</p>
        <p>I focus on connecting business strategy, operating models and technology investment to create meaningful and sustainable change.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="focus-card">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box"><Layers size={23} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true" /></span><span>02</span></div>
        <h3>Enterprise Architecture &amp; Engineering</h3>
        <p>Architecture is a business decision.</p>
        <p>Reusable capabilities, sound engineering practices and clear ownership enable organisations to innovate faster, reduce complexity and respond to change.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="focus-card">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="icon-box"><Scale size={23} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true" /></span><span>03</span></div>
        <h3>AI &amp; Human Judgement</h3>
        <p>AI is fundamentally changing how we design, build and operate businesses.</p>
        <p>The opportunity is not simply to automate more work, but to rethink how humans and intelligent systems collaborate, with human judgement, verification and accountability remaining central.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
